    <unit id="ApiEventClosed">
      <segment>
        <source>Raised when the close action is clicked.</source>
        <target state="translated">Emitido quando o fechar ação é clicado.</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="BasicDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>Usage of basic Tag, and it could be IsClosable and customize close button by set closeIcon property,will display default close button when closeIcon is setting to true. IsClosable Tag supports onClose events.</source>
        <target state="translated">Uso de básico Tag, e isso could ser IsClosable e personalizar fechar botão por definir closeIcon propriedade,irá exibir padrão fechar botão quando closeIcon é configuração para true. IsClosable Tag oferece suporte onClose events.</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="BasicTitle">
      <segment>
        <source>Basic</source>
        <target state="translated">Básico</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="CheckableTagDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>CheckableTag works like Checkbox. CheckableTagGroup provides single and multiple selection over a shared option set.</source>
        <target state="translated">CheckableTag funciona like Checkbox. CheckableTagGroup provides single e múltiplos seleção over a shared opção definir.</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="CheckableTagTitle">
      <segment>
        <source>Checkable</source>
