      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="ColorfulTagDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>We preset a series of colorful tag styles for use in different situations. You can also set it to a hex color string for custom color.</source>
        <target state="translated">Nós predefinido a series de colorful tag styles para usar em diferente situations. Você pode also definir isso para a hex cor string para personalizado cor.</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
